    ["<DecH>工艺：</>沉黑皮革・蓄力轻战甲\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Deep Black Leather - Power-Charging Light Armor\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
